$DIR/test.p:3:9: copy (built-in) must be called
    A builtin function such as len or cap is used as a value. Builtins can only
    be called; wrap the call in a function literal if you need a func value.
    (see "Built-in functions" in the Plutonium spec, section 13)
    (run "pluto explain E0082" for a longer explanation)
